  "raw_meta_yaml": "context:\n  version: \"1.27.0\"\n\npackage:\n  name: openmodelica\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/OpenModelica/OpenModelica/releases/download/v${{ version }}/OpenModelica-v${{ version }}-src-with-submodules.zip\n  sha256: 8bb23c0ae3dc1e8b2eed84f2ee24b0014ba837015a9230a5e0237d6789071bff\n  patches:\n    # drop erroneous _GNU_SOURCE define (error seems specific to conda-forge)\n    - fmilib-gnusource.patch\n    # Add OM_USE_SYSTEM_ZLIB option to fix stdio.h:210:7: error: expected identifier or '(' (updated to zlib 1.3.2 upstream)\n    - zlib.patch\n    # add macos/aarch64 platforms (https://github.com/robbr48/fmi4c/pull/97)\n    - fmi4c.patch\n    # nuke webkit (https://github.com/OpenModelica/OpenModelica/pull/15981)\n    - webkit.patch\n    # boost includes (https://github.com/OpenModelica/OpenModelica/pull/15982)\n    - boost.patch\n    # SyntaxError (https://github.com/OpenModelica/OpenModelica/pull/15983)\n    - syntaxerror.patch\n    # error: no member named 'random_shuffle' in namespace 'std' (https://github.com/OpenModelica/OMCompiler-3rdParty/pull/219)\n    - random_shuffle.patch\n    # ld: unknown option: --no-undefined (https://github.com/OpenModelica/OpenModelica/pull/15990)\n    - undefined.patch\n    # cc1: error: '-Werror=c23-extensions': no option '-Wc23-extensions (https://github.com/OpenModelica/OpenModelica/pull/16297)\n    - 0001-SimRT-C-Mismatching-clang-flags.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 2\n  skip:\n    - win\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - cmake\n    - ninja\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('fortran') }}\n    - if: unix\n      then:\n        - pkg-config\n        - autoconf\n        - automake\n        - make\n  host:\n    - openjdk\n    - libblas\n    - liblapack\n    - libcurl\n    - libboost-devel\n    - libffi\n    - libiconv\n    - qt-webengine\n    - openscenegraph\n    - if: linux\n      then:\n        - libgl-devel\n        - libegl-devel\n  run:\n    - openjdk\n    - cmake\n    - make\n    - zip\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n  run_constraints:\n    - omcompiler <0\n\ntests:\n  - script:\n      - omc --version\n      - OMEdit --help\n      - OMSimulator --help\n      - echo 'loadFile(\"OMCompiler/Examples/Circle.mo\"); getErrorString(); buildModelFMU(Circle); getErrorString();' > export.mos\n      - omc export.mos\n      - ls Circle.fmu\n      - OMSimulator Circle.fmu\n      - echo 'loadFile(\"OMCompiler/Examples/Circle.mo\"); getErrorString(); buildModelFMU(Circle, platforms={\"dynamic\"}); getErrorString();' > export.mos\n      - omc --fmuCMakeBuild=true --fmuRuntimeDepends=modelica export.mos\n      - ls Circle.fmu\n      - OMSimulator Circle.fmu\n    files:\n      source:\n        - OMCompiler/Examples/Circle.mo\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://openmodelica.org/\n  license: LicenseRef-OSMC-PL\n  license_family: GPL\n  license_file:\n    - OSMC-License.txt\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/antlr/3.2/libantlr3c-3.2/COPYING\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/Cdaskr/LICENSE\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/CMinpack/CopyrightMINPACK.txt\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/gc/README.md\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/FMIL/LICENSE.md\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/libffi/LICENSE\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/libzmq/COPYING.LESSER\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/lis-1.4.12/COPYING\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/metis-5.1.0/LICENSE.txt\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/moo-0.1.0/COPYING.LESSER\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/open62541/open62541.txt\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/primme-3.2.3/COPYING.txt\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/ryu/LICENSE-Apache2\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/SuiteSparse-5.8.1/LICENSE.txt\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/sundials-5.4.0/LICENSE\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/zlib/LICENSE\n  summary: The Open Source Modelica Suite\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - jschueller\n",
